---
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#070a12] py-12 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between">
    {/* 4-Column Sitemap (Mobile: 1st, Desktop: Right) */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12 w-full lg:w-auto order-1 lg:order-2">
      {/* Column 1: Framework */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 uppercase">
          프레임워크
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a href="/workflow/" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              워크플로우
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/prompts/" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              프롬프트
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/documents/" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              문서
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/showcase/" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              쇼케이스
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/faq/" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              자주 묻는 질문
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/replworks/replworks.github.io"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              GitHub
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Column 2: Tools */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 uppercase">
          도구
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/replworks/repl-cli"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              repl-cli
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/replworks/ai-issue"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              ai-issue
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/replworks/coolrestore"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              coolrestore
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Column 3: Repositories */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 uppercase">
          저장소
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://apt.repl.net"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              APT - Linux
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://brew.repl.net"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              Homebrew - MacOS
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Column 4: Live Services */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 uppercase">
          서비스
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://wifinote.net"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              와이파이 노트
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://if.repl.net"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              ImageForge
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* About Block (Mobile: 2nd, Desktop: Left) */}
    <div class="max-w-sm space-y-3 shrink-0 order-2 lg:order-1">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 group">
        <img
          src="/logo-tight-margin-1024-1024.svg"
          alt="REPL Works"
          class="h-6 w-6 object-contain group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        />
        <span class="font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-cyan-600 dark:group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
          REPL Works
        </span>
      </a>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        AI 에이전트와 사람이 프로젝트의 기억과 의도를 문서와 Git에 축적하며 함께
        개발하는 문서 주도 AI 개발 프레임워크.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400/80 font-semibold">
        Models change. Projects survive.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 pt-1">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/replworks"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          aria-label="GitHub"
          class="text-slate-400 transition hover:text-cyan-400"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="16"
            height="16"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="currentColor"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M12 0C5.374 0 0 5.373 0 12c0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23A11.509 11.509 0 0 1 12 5.803c1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576C20.566 21.797 24 17.3 24 12c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/replworks"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          aria-label="LinkedIn"
          class="text-slate-400 transition hover:text-cyan-400"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="16"
            height="16"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="currentColor"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:works@repl.net"
          aria-label="이메일 문의"
          class="text-slate-400 transition hover:text-cyan-400"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="16"
            height="16"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2" />
            <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-7xl border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 px-4 pt-6 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 sm:px-6 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
    <p>
      REPL Works <span class="hidden sm:inline">· Open Source Framework</span> ·
      MIT License
    </p>
    <p class="text-cyan-500/60">Built for AI-Native Builders</p>
  </div>
</footer>
